sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant PG as PostgreSQL Query Executor
    participant Parser as FTS Parser/Dictionary
    participant GIN as GIN Index
    participant Heap as Table (Heap)

    App->>PG: Submit full-text search query (e.g., WHERE tsvector_column @@ tsquery)
    PG->>Parser: Parse tsquery, extract search lexemes
    Parser-->>PG: Return lexemes (normalized search terms)
    PG->>GIN: Lookup lexemes in GIN index
    GIN-->>PG: Return list of matching row pointers (TIDs) for each lexeme
    PG->>PG: Intersect/union TID lists as per tsquery logic (AND/OR/NOT)
    loop For each matching TID
        PG->>Heap: Fetch row from heap using TID
        Heap-->>PG: Return row data
        PG->>PG: Recheck row if necessary (e.g., for phrase search or ranking)
    end
    PG-->>App: Return result set (matching rows)
